# AI Working State
Last updated: 2026-10-02

Small on purpose: where the work stopped, where the detail lives, and the
cross-cutting decisions that must not be re-litigated. Anything readable off
the code, CLAUDE.md, CHANGELOG.md or git history is deliberately NOT here.

Read this first. Then read `state/<track>.md` for the track you are touching —
and only that one.

